        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Street Food Simulator&quot; is a first-person simulation that lets you calmly manage every detail of running a street food stall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grill the Perfection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of grilling! Serve up delicious, perfectly cooked food to satisfy your customers’ cravings, timing each item just right to keep everyone happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/19fdbc5aa46bb1c8571c3fef856148ee.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/19fdbc5aa46bb1c8571c3fef856148ee.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/19fdbc5aa46bb1c8571c3fef856148ee.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Best Spot in City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city to discover the ideal locations where hungry crowds gather, maximizing your sales and making your food cart a popular stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/466f6066e6104fa224d71c286b3d0f00.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/466f6066e6104fa224d71c286b3d0f00.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/466f6066e6104fa224d71c286b3d0f00.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Cart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkvarious carts in market and customize them to your preference. Purchase refrigerators, radios, grills and more. Give them a fresh look with different paint colors. Aim to stand out and leave a lasting impression across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/3f1656e1ea379d3d96d6bb56f8fc3f2f.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/3f1656e1ea379d3d96d6bb56f8fc3f2f.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/3f1656e1ea379d3d96d6bb56f8fc3f2f.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competitors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win over your competitors, each of whom brings unique skills and approaches to the table. They operate in different parts of the city, each with their own strategies and strengths. Understanding their differences will give you an edge in outperforming them and dominating the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/564057dcd5dffa23364c657267a5cb1f.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/564057dcd5dffa23364c657267a5cb1f.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/564057dcd5dffa23364c657267a5cb1f.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your street food empire by taking on new challenges, offering more menu items, and attracting loyal customers to fuel your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Street Food Simulator&quot; is a first-person simulation that lets you calmly manage every detail of running a street food stall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grill the Perfection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of grilling! Serve up delicious, perfectly cooked food to satisfy your customers’ cravings, timing each item just right to keep everyone happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/19fdbc5aa46bb1c8571c3fef856148ee.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/19fdbc5aa46bb1c8571c3fef856148ee.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/19fdbc5aa46bb1c8571c3fef856148ee.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Best Spot in City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city to discover the ideal locations where hungry crowds gather, maximizing your sales and making your food cart a popular stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/466f6066e6104fa224d71c286b3d0f00.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/466f6066e6104fa224d71c286b3d0f00.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/466f6066e6104fa224d71c286b3d0f00.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Cart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkvarious carts in market and customize them to your preference. Purchase refrigerators, radios, grills and more. Give them a fresh look with different paint colors. Aim to stand out and leave a lasting impression across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/3f1656e1ea379d3d96d6bb56f8fc3f2f.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/3f1656e1ea379d3d96d6bb56f8fc3f2f.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/3f1656e1ea379d3d96d6bb56f8fc3f2f.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competitors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win over your competitors, each of whom brings unique skills and approaches to the table. They operate in different parts of the city, each with their own strategies and strengths. Understanding their differences will give you an edge in outperforming them and dominating the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/564057dcd5dffa23364c657267a5cb1f.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/564057dcd5dffa23364c657267a5cb1f.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/564057dcd5dffa23364c657267a5cb1f.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your street food empire by taking on new challenges, offering more menu items, and attracting loyal customers to fuel your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.poster.avif?t=1780605368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.webm?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.mp4?t=1780605368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
